1. Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/mahtabalam139/production-monitoring-dashboard.git
cd production-monitoring-dashboard
2. Build the Docker image
docker build -t monitoring-dashboard:1.0 .
3. Run the container
docker run -d --name monitoring-dashboard -p 8000:8000 -v //var/run/docker.sock:/var/run/docker.sock monitoring-dashboard:1.0
4. Verify
Open:
http://localhost:8000/dashboard


If Docker isn't installed on the office PC

You can still run the project locally:

python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
uvicorn backend.main:app --reload
